WEBVTT

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:12.672
The model field used to say Antigravity account default. In Configuration, code reviews now show Gemini Flash by name. Open the list and the Default badge sits on the same Gemini Flash row.

00:00:13.626 --> 00:00:20.466
Project settings mark the inherited harness the same way. Antigravity appears once, with the Default badge beside its name.

00:00:21.418 --> 00:00:28.658
The task picker marks Claude Code and the configured worker model, Sonnet. Choose any other model for this task from the same list.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:35.810
A new chat follows the project’s model for Seismic. Here that is Haiku, shown once with its Default badge.
